; Jump to the routine in IY
;
; A trampoline: the noun lookup #R$7CFC and #R$7D54 set IY to #R$9DD9 (look
; among objects) or #R$9EA0 (look among exits) and call this. The registers
; pass through to that routine, which returns to the caller of this one.
;
; IY Address of the routine to run
; HL Noun phrase words (RecBuf1 or RecBuf2) for that routine
@label=CallIY
c$7CC9 JP (IY)       ;
